{
  "summary": "The experiment tested switching fusion from concatenation to weighted in a high-performing multimodal setup with scvi_n200 RNA and ImageNet ViT-L image encoders. Validation accuracy decreased slightly to 0.7062 (F1: 0.6671) compared to the concat baseline (0.7150), suggesting no clear advantage of weighted fusion. The exact impact of fusion strategy remains uncertain without further comparison to other configurations."
}

